{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0376-s001", "text": "Ett skyddshem är ett ställe där personer som upplevt våld i nära relationer eller hot om sådant får hjälp och trygghet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T043416099313Z/hb-c09-u0376-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.891700680272109, "peak": 0.28564453125, "generation_seconds": 39.675266972975805, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0376-s002", "text": "En person kan gå till ett skyddshem om hen inte kan gå till sitt eget hem på grund av till exempel våld, hot eller rädsla.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T043416099313Z/hb-c09-u0376-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.100680272108843, "peak": 0.2730712890625, "generation_seconds": 42.72899453807622, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0376-s003", "text": "Skyddshemmet är hemlikt och har anställda på plats dygnet runt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T043416099313Z/hb-c09-u0376-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.50312925170068, "peak": 0.281585693359375, "generation_seconds": 20.71798086981289, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0376-s004", "text": "De anställda hjälper till att lösa krisen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T043416099313Z/hb-c09-u0376-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.040272108843538, "peak": 0.37420654296875, "generation_seconds": 16.559787958860397, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0376-s005", "text": "Ett skyddshem är avsett som ett tillfälligt ställe att bo på, men hur länge en person bor där beror på det individuella behovet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T043416099313Z/hb-c09-u0376-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.309659863945578, "peak": 0.271697998046875, "generation_seconds": 37.94093717704527, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0376-s006", "text": "Skyddshemmens tjänster är avgiftsfria.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T043416099313Z/hb-c09-u0376-s006.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.7616326530612243, "peak": 0.295623779296875, "generation_seconds": 15.968800497008488, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0377-s001", "text": "Man kan gå till ett skyddshem alltid när det inte är tryggt att vara där hemma.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T043416099313Z/hb-c09-u0377-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.6873469387755105, "peak": 0.289520263671875, "generation_seconds": 22.3311233620625, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0377-s002", "text": "Det behöver alltså inte förekomma fysiskt våld i hemmet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T043416099313Z/hb-c09-u0377-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.876190476190477, "peak": 0.33746337890625, "generation_seconds": 20.27146332198754, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0377-s003", "text": "Också psykiskt våld, till exempel mycket kontrollerande beteende eller hot om våld, kan vara en orsak till att söka skydd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T043827956769Z/hb-c09-u0377-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.379319727891156, "peak": 0.26239013671875, "generation_seconds": 36.26522455411032, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0378-s001", "text": "Skyddshemmens tjänster är till för alla kön.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T043827956769Z/hb-c09-u0378-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.179591836734694, "peak": 0.3353271484375, "generation_seconds": 16.132969731930643, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0378-s002", "text": "Man kan också ta med sig barnen till skyddshemmet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T043827956769Z/hb-c09-u0378-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.458231292517007, "peak": 0.31280517578125, "generation_seconds": 13.579011047026142, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0378-s003", "text": "Till skyddshemmen kan man ringa när som helst, också på natten.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T043827956769Z/hb-c09-u0378-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.50312925170068, "peak": 0.2862548828125, "generation_seconds": 20.408297510119155, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0379-s001", "text": "Ett mödrahem är en plats dit en mamma kan komma med sin baby om hon är i en svår livssituation eller om hon är helt ensam.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T043827956769Z/hb-c09-u0379-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.518639455782314, "peak": 0.3292236328125, "generation_seconds": 38.32515920000151, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0379-s002", "text": "Ett mödrahem är avsett främst för gravida mammor och mammor med små babyer.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T043827956769Z/hb-c09-u0379-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.408707482993197, "peak": 0.315216064453125, "generation_seconds": 24.27160943998024, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0379-s003", "text": "Också den andra föräldern eller mammans partner kan bo på mödrahemmet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T043827956769Z/hb-c09-u0379-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.060408163265306, "peak": 0.271759033203125, "generation_seconds": 20.768105729017407, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0379-s004", "text": "På mödrahemmet får man i en trygg miljö öva på att ta hand om babyn och på vardagen med en baby.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T043827956769Z/hb-c09-u0379-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.9412244897959186, "peak": 0.240570068359375, "generation_seconds": 26.76952075609006, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0380-s001", "text": "Om du behöver brådskande hjälp av polisen, ring nödnumret 112.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T044214862138Z/hb-c09-u0380-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.757006802721088, "peak": 0.252349853515625, "generation_seconds": 23.58260060590692, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0380-s002", "text": "Du ska ringa nödnumret endast i brådskande fall där livet, hälsan, egendomen eller miljön är i fara.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T044214862138Z/hb-c09-u0380-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.428843537414966, "peak": 0.315948486328125, "generation_seconds": 27.072579748928547, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0381-s001", "text": "Nollalinja är en hjälptelefon som du kan ringa om du har blivit utsatt för våld i familjen eller sexuellt våld eller hot om våld.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T044214862138Z/hb-c09-u0381-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.145578231292516, "peak": 0.25750732421875, "generation_seconds": 36.09130661096424, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0381-s002", "text": "Du kan ringa när som helst.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T044214862138Z/hb-c09-u0381-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.716734693877551, "peak": 0.25799560546875, "generation_seconds": 9.721432843944058, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0381-s003", "text": "Medarbetarna pratar finska, svenska och engelska.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T044214862138Z/hb-c09-u0381-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.806530612244898, "peak": 0.37713623046875, "generation_seconds": 16.631150831002742, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0382-s001", "text": "Nollalinja erbjuder också tolktjänst.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T044214862138Z/hb-c09-u0382-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.900952380952381, "peak": 0.269683837890625, "generation_seconds": 13.820960416924208, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0382-s002", "text": "Tolkningsspråken är ryska, ukrainska, spanska, farsi, arabiska, somali, dari, sorani och thai.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T044214862138Z/hb-c09-u0382-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.70748299319728, "peak": 0.34661865234375, "generation_seconds": 29.558385455049574, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0383-s001", "text": "Samtal till Nollalinja är kostnadsfria och de syns inte i telefonräkningen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T044214862138Z/hb-c09-u0383-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.826666666666667, "peak": 0.322784423828125, "generation_seconds": 22.943001607898623, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0383-s002", "text": "Du behöver inte uppge ditt namn när du ringer.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T044546246209Z/hb-c09-u0383-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.900952380952381, "peak": 0.2646484375, "generation_seconds": 15.110358375823125, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0383-s003", "text": "Nollalinja är avsedd för både kvinnor och män.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T044546246209Z/hb-c09-u0383-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.527891156462585, "peak": 0.247711181640625, "generation_seconds": 15.58748855208978, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0384-s001", "text": "På många orter finns ett SERI-stödcenter (SERI-tukikeskus) som är avsett för offer för sexuellt våld.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T044546246209Z/hb-c09-u0384-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.24, "peak": 0.30322265625, "generation_seconds": 30.276255242992193, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0384-s002", "text": "SERI-stödcentret hjälper och ger råd till offer för sexuellt våld.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T044546246209Z/hb-c09-u0384-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.548027210884354, "peak": 0.27374267578125, "generation_seconds": 14.453915958059952, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0384-s003", "text": "Centret erbjuder bland annat medicinsk undersökning och psykologhjälp.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T044546246209Z/hb-c09-u0384-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.199727891156463, "peak": 0.341522216796875, "generation_seconds": 16.767004157183692, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0384-s004", "text": "Stödcentret betjänar alla, oavsett kön.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T044546246209Z/hb-c09-u0384-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.900952380952381, "peak": 0.34893798828125, "generation_seconds": 13.290563883027062, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0384-s005", "text": "Tjänsterna är kostnadsfria.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T044546246209Z/hb-c09-u0384-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.0650340136054424, "peak": 0.2791748046875, "generation_seconds": 10.653614267008379, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0384-s006", "text": "Du kan uppsöka SERI-stödcentret på egen hand, men det rekommenderas att du ringer i förväg.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T044546246209Z/hb-c09-u0384-s006.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.219863945578231, "peak": 0.255645751953125, "generation_seconds": 22.16414186381735, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0385-s001", "text": "Du kan också alltid söka hjälp vid social- och hälsocentralen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T044831543745Z/hb-c09-u0385-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.642448979591837, "peak": 0.460418701171875, "generation_seconds": 15.602599824080244, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0386-s001", "text": "Om någon upprepade gånger hotar eller trakasserar dig och du vill ha skydd, kan du ansöka om besöksförbud (lähestymiskielto) för denna person.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T044831543745Z/hb-c09-u0386-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.329795918367347, "peak": 0.31024169921875, "generation_seconds": 33.62114607798867, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0386-s002", "text": "Besöksförbudet innebär att personen inte får ta kontakt med dig.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T044831543745Z/hb-c09-u0386-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.50312925170068, "peak": 0.34857177734375, "generation_seconds": 13.64047498605214, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0386-s003", "text": "Du kan ansöka om besöksförbud hos polisen eller i tingsrätten.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T044831543745Z/hb-c09-u0386-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.712108843537415, "peak": 0.59014892578125, "generation_seconds": 16.232217213138938, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0386-s004", "text": "Du kan fråga om råd vid socialbyrån eller rättshjälpsbyrån i din hemkommun.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T044831543745Z/hb-c09-u0386-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.548027210884354, "peak": 0.293243408203125, "generation_seconds": 18.701166498009115, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0386-s005", "text": "Om du har bevis på hot och trakasserier är det bra att spara dem.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skydd/narration-resume-20261103T044831543745Z/hb-c09-u0386-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.060408163265306, "peak": 0.284027099609375, "generation_seconds": 19.610801831120625, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
